{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(of:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(where:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/grouped(by:where:rate:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Type Methods","anchor":"Type-Methods"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRate","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/InvalidSampleRate"],"generated":true,"title":"Sampling","anchor":"Sampling"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"Sampler","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Sampler.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Sampler.swift#L28"},"symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker built with samplers runs them on its worker, after its enrichers, so a sampler sees","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what they set:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker(samplers: [","    .events(of: Scrolled.self, rate: try SampleRate(0.1)),","    .events(where: { $0.consentCategory == .performance }, rate: try SampleRate(0.5)),","])"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each sampler decides on its own, and a record is kept only if every sampler that applies to it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps it. A kept record carries the product of their rates as its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; one no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler applies to is always kept and carries no key. Each dropped record is reported on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The decisions come from the tracker’s sampling seed, the same on every platform and Swift","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"release: with a seed fixed, which events are kept is fixed too. Each sampler draws from a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream of its own, picked by its place in the tracker’s list: appending a sampler changes no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other’s decisions, but inserting, removing or reordering one gives every sampler after it a new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream, so it decides differently under the same seed.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler"